  **Instead of calling this op directly most users will want to use the
  NumPy-style slicing syntax (e.g. `tensor[..., 3:4:-1, tf.newaxis, 3]`), which
  is supported via `tf.Tensor.__getitem__` and `tf.Variable.__getitem__`.**
